.Student Performance Prediction Using Machine Learning

Project Overview:-

This project predicts student academic performance using Machine Learning techniques, particularly Multiple Linear Regression.

Objectives:-

Understand Machine Learning fundamentals.

Implement Linear Regression.

Analyze student performance data.

Train and evaluate a prediction model.

Predict student scores using input features.

Technologies Used:-

Python

Pandas

NumPy

Matplotlib

Scikit-learn

Google Colab

Project Workflow:-

Dataset Collection

Data Preprocessing

Exploratory Data Analysis

Model Training

Model Testing

Performance Evaluation

Student Score Prediction

